<http://purl.org/vocab/frbr/core#Work> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> (frbre:ReferentialWork
